{"asset_key":"mn/gameplay_story_10640070","episode":"mn","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"10640070","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1064007001:0":{"text":"이제 마지막 식재료야! 농축된 원소 에센스만 있으면 혼돈 이계의 어둠 소환 스튜를 만들 수 있어!","source_cn":"只差最后一种食材——浓郁的元素精华，我们就能制作混沌虚...","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1064007002:1":{"text":"이번에는 순조로웠으면 좋겠는데...","source_cn":"希望这次能顺利一点……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x47ACB46555129076","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1064007002":{"text":"이번에는 순조로웠으면 좋겠는데...","source_cn":"希望这次能顺利一点……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x47ACB46555129076","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1064007003:0":{"text":"그럼 안심이네!","source_cn":"那我就放心了！","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0x4C614FFA6BCA61CB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1064007004:0":{"text":"이번 목적지는 어떤 곳이야?","source_cn":"那这次，我们要去的地方是什么样的呢？","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0xFC01B92E50F5261F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:9:1064007004":{"text":"이번 목적지는 어떤 곳이야?","source_cn":"那这次，我们要去的地方是什么样的呢？","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0xFC01B92E50F5261F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1064007005:1":{"text":"두 지역이 있어요. 하나는 지상인데, 거기에는 드워프 장인들의 마을인 깊은바위 마을이 있죠.","source_cn":"这里有两个区域，一个是地面之上，那里有一个矮人工匠村—...","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1064007006:1":{"text":"드워프인가...","source_cn":"矮人啊……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xF7233F9348C519DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1064007007:1":{"text":"그리고 다른 하나는 지하에 있어요. 저희가 갈 곳은 지하의 용암 지대예요.","source_cn":"另一个就是地底，我们这次去的就是位于那里的熔岩区。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xF9D1F64F37956588","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1064007008:1":{"text":"드래곤이 살았던 아주 특별한 곳이죠.","source_cn":"那里很特别，还曾经生活着龙呢。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x38D33BA3F27E4A64","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1064007009:1":{"text":"뭐? 드래곤?!","source_cn":"什么？！龙？！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x28A1F1A795961702","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1064007010:1":{"text":"라이오스 씨, 너무 흥분하지 말아요. 드래곤은 이미 날아가 버렸으니까요.","source_cn":"莱欧斯，你不要太激动，龙已经飞走了。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x747316238B5D10D7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1064007011:1":{"text":"...한발 늦었네.","source_cn":"……来晚了呢。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xD460EB7FE64A376B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1064007012:1":{"text":"...뭘 아쉬워하는 거야?","source_cn":"……你在遗憾什么啊？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x82B6D7C0448C530D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1064007013:0":{"text":"어차피 이렇게 된 거... 뭐 좀 물어봐도 될까?","source_cn":"既然已经这样了……那我可以问几个问题吗？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x76093BFB1492AE4D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:24:1064007013":{"text":"어차피 이렇게 된 거... 뭐 좀 물어봐도 될까?","source_cn":"既然已经这样了……那我可以问几个问题吗？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x76093BFB1492AE4D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1064007014:1":{"text":"좋아. 그럼 시초의 드래곤과 레드 드래곤은 뭐가 다르지?","source_cn":"好，请问初始之龙跟炎龙有什么区别？","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0x477F8D938F68B589","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1064007015:1":{"text":"체형은 어때? 불은 뿜을 수 있어?","source_cn":"体型大小如何？会喷火吗？","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0x0EDE95F5D84F6CE2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1064007016:1":{"text":"사는 환경은? 고기는 어떤 맛이야?","source_cn":"生活的环境怎么样呢？肉又是什么味道的呢？","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0x62A08B505E0CF1FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:29:1064007016":{"text":"사는 환경은? 고기는 어떤 맛이야?","source_cn":"生活的环境怎么样呢？肉又是什么味道的呢？","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0x62A08B505E0CF1FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1064007017:1":{"text":"아... 아쉽네.","source_cn":"啊……太可惜了。","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0x5FAA94A76ECF2772","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1064007018:0":{"text":"넌 또 뭘 아쉬워하는 거야?!","source_cn":"你又在可惜什么啊？！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xABF36B8A78A54202","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:33:1064007018":{"text":"넌 또 뭘 아쉬워하는 거야?!","source_cn":"你又在可惜什么啊？！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xABF36B8A78A54202","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1064007019:1":{"text":"드래곤의 알!!! 꼭 봐야겠어! 한 번도 본 적 없다고!","source_cn":"真的吗！？我还没有见过龙蛋！","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0x6048B03FA59347E8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1064007020:1":{"text":"드래곤이라는 생물이 알에서 부화한다고 생각하니까, 온 몸에 소름이 돋아.","source_cn":"一想到龙这种生物是从龙蛋里孵化出来，我就忍不住战栗了起来。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x1B35AF7ADD66BB29","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1064007021:1":{"text":"생명은 참 신비로워... 알에서 태어나서 저렇게 커다란 생물로 자라다니...","source_cn":"生物真的很不可思议呢……竟然能从那样的蛋成长为如此强大...","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1064007022:1":{"text":"넘쳐나는 마물 사랑, 또 시작이네...","source_cn":"又开始了……魔物控……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x3C6A3CE284E71115","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1064007023:1":{"text":"속도를 더 높이자! 더는 못 참겠어!","source_cn":"快点走吧！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x124B9E464C1E9B5D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:42:1064007024:1":{"text":"라이오스의 재촉 속에, 우리는 무사히 포지 피오르에 도착했다","source_cn":"","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:43:1064007025:1":{"text":"북적이는 깊은바위 마을을 지나 광산에 들어간 우리는 낯익은 드워프 친구, 조아를 만났다","source_cn":"","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:45:1064007026:0":{"text":"조아, 오랜만이에요!","source_cn":"祖娅，好久不见！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x82AA61640572FA92","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:46:1064007027:1":{"text":"오! 너희들이구나. 그 뒤에 네 사람은...","source_cn":"嗨，是你们啊！后面这四个……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x0E719044DFEF8386","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:47:1064007028:1":{"text":"보기 드문 조합이네.","source_cn":"真是一个少见的组合啊。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x44A04D3687AC16AF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:48:1064007028":{"text":"보기 드문 조합이네.","source_cn":"真是一个少见的组合啊。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x44A04D3687AC16AF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:50:1064007029:1":{"text":"서로 소개해 주는 건 좋은 일이지만, 여러 번 반복하니까 조금 지겹네요.","source_cn":"虽然能让大家认识很开心，但每次都要介绍也是挺累的呢……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x02157CC89E9D45F8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:51:1064007030:1":{"text":"불평하지 마, 햄스터. 요즘 나도 외지인을 많이 봤다고.","source_cn":"别抱怨了，我最近可是一直不停的自我介绍呢。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x413B214C77F8EAD5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:52:1064007031:1":{"text":"투자니 운송이니, 무슨 연구니... 줄줄이 찾아와서 머리가 터질 지경이었단 말이야.","source_cn":"什么投资啊、运输啊、研究啊，接二连三地来，说实话我已经...","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:53:1064007032:1":{"text":"너희가 센시를 나한테 소개해서, 여기서 채광하게 하려는 건 줄 알았어.","source_cn":"我差点以为你们介绍森西过来采矿呢。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xFADC9B7716297F1B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:55:1064007033:1":{"text":"...나는 요리사라네.","source_cn":"……老夫，可以说是个厨师之类的人吧。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xE22F96227764D3CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:56:1064007034:1":{"text":"아, 그래? 참 드문 드워프네.","source_cn":"啊，这样啊。这在矮人中也是挺少见的哈。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x4F53CA135E89A7A8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:58:1064007035:1":{"text":"...분위기가 죽은 거 같은데.","source_cn":"……天好像聊死了。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x47218F8EAA64E8B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:59:1064007036:1":{"text":"저기, 그게... 어쨌든 이제 원소 에센스를 구하러 가자.","source_cn":"那个，这个……总之我们现在去弄元素精华吧。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xFF029370138E8C86","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:61:1064007037:1":{"text":"조아 동생, 만나서 반가웠어. 나중에 또 봐!","source_cn":"祖娅小妹妹，很高兴认识你，再见！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x74676E523C79C6CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:62:1064007038:1":{"text":"하하하하, 또 이러네!","source_cn":"哈哈哈哈！又来了！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xAEE36259EE5B91F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:63:1064007039:1":{"text":"동생은 무슨, 나 수백 살은 먹었거든!","source_cn":"我可不是小妹妹！我几百岁了哦！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x7A35BCE1B4335EFF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:65:1064007040:1":{"text":"드워프의 나이는 정말 알아보기 힘들구나.","source_cn":"矮人的年龄也太难分辨了吧。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x7FCD3BEC448B664F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:66:1064007040":{"text":"드워프의 나이는 정말 알아보기 힘들구나.","source_cn":"矮人的年龄也太难分辨了吧。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x7FCD3BEC448B664F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:67:1064007041:1":{"text":"드래곤의 알 에센스를 실수로 먹어서 성장이 멈춰버렸거든.","source_cn":"我这是误服龙蛋液导致的停止生长。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x1F6558B11A37D477","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:69:1064007042:0":{"text":"드래곤의 알 에센스?! 그런 부작용이 있다니...","source_cn":"龙蛋液？！还有这种副作用……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x95F9FF0F64F40BC5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:70:1064007043:0":{"text":"좋아, 식재료 후보에서 하나 제외야.","source_cn":"唉，又少了一种能吃的食材。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x947C38D4C2FB13BE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:72:1064007044:1":{"text":"...또 먹을 생각이었냐?!","source_cn":"……你还真想过吃啊？！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xC59F3EA9F8560DD7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:74:1064007045:1":{"text":"아아, 미안해. 전혀 몰랐어. 그냥 어린 드워프인 줄로만 알았지!","source_cn":"啊啊，对不起，我完全没看出来！我以为您只是个年轻矮人！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xBF23782BA7797E6B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:75:1064007046:1":{"text":"정말 미안!","source_cn":"实在太不好意思了！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x27D39431AFAD3E0D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:76:1064007047:1":{"text":"헤헤, 신경 쓰지 마. 가끔 이걸로 처음 만나는 사람들 놀래켜주는 재미가 있거든.","source_cn":"嘿嘿，别放在心上。偶尔用这个吓新认识的人一跳，还是挺有...","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:77:1064007048:1":{"text":"너희 표정만 봐도 충분히 보람찼어.","source_cn":"你们现在的表情也值回票价了。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xF7BD944003079E86","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:78:1064007048":{"text":"너희 표정만 봐도 충분히 보람찼어.","source_cn":"你们现在的表情也值回票价了。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xF7BD944003079E86","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:79:1064007049:1":{"text":"다 그 핑크 머리 뾰족귀 때문이야. 설마 이번에도 그 녀석이랑 얽힌 건 아니지?","source_cn":"都怪那个粉毛尖耳朵。你们这次不会也要跟他打交道吧？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x92B59454CA66AB53","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:80:1064007050:1":{"text":"뾰족귀? 에스페리아에도 엘프가 있어?","source_cn":"尖耳朵？伊索米亚这里也有精灵吗？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x4EAD5D2E71C572DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:81:1064007051:1":{"text":"그러고 보니 귀가 좀 닮은 것도 같네...","source_cn":"这么说来，耳朵确实有一点像……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x38AD35026130C557","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:83:1064007052:0":{"text":"정확히 말하면 엘프는 아니고요, 뭔가 특별하고 복잡한 과거를 가진 종족이 있어요...","source_cn":"但准确来说，他们不是精灵。是有着特殊复杂过去的族群……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x4040ED98DBA25B1C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:84:1064007053:0":{"text":"별로 유쾌한 이야기는 아니야.","source_cn":"那可不是什么多有意思的事情。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x9A575E2B58C73A17","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:86:1064007054:1":{"text":"가면서 이야기하자. 마침 애쉬 크리스탈을 채집하러 가려던 길이었든.","source_cn":"我们边走边聊吧，我准备去采集点暗烬晶体。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xEEE6367FB5927BF1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:87:1064007055:1":{"text":"핀이 애쉬 머쉬룸 수프라는 새로운 레시피를 알려줬어.","source_cn":"芬恩教了我一个新食谱——晶化伞菇浓汤。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x4AE7F7368D84B15E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:89:1064007056:1":{"text":"이름만 들어도 무서운데요...","source_cn":"这名字，听起来不是很好吃……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x8781C7F18B561ED7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:90:1064007057:1":{"text":"어이! 요리는 연구랑 똑같아. 늘 같은 방식만 고집하면 안 된다고. 가끔은 모험을 해야 진짜 놀라움이 따라오는 법이지.","source_cn":"嘿！做菜就像搞研究，不能故步自封。有时候冒险才有惊喜！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x03448A708930609A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:92:1064007058:1":{"text":"그건 동의하네. 나도 미궁에서 다양한 마물 조합을 시도해 보았지...","source_cn":"老夫很同意这个说法。在迷宫里，老夫也经常尝试各种魔物组合……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xCD58A83E42836B00","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:93:1064007059:1":{"text":"마침내 공통 관심사를 찾아낸 조아와 센시는 연구와 요리의 공통점에 대해 이야기를 나누기 시작했다","source_cn":"","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:94:1064007060:1":{"text":"그리고 우리는 함께 아케인 승강기를 타고 각자 필요한 식재료를 찾아 나섰다","source_cn":"","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:78:0:1":{"text":"조아, 유머 감각이 늘었네","source_cn":"祖娅，你学坏了","status":"